<newsitem itemid="446536" id="root" date="1997-03-17" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Fralex half year share rises.</title>
<headline>Fralex half year share rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Headline shr (cts)    14.6	  vs 11.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 3.0	   vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   9.83	  vs 6.92</p>
<p>    Headline attrib	 7.07	  vs 5.66</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   22.71	 vs 15.25</p>
<p>    Tax			 9.03	  vs 3.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		  264.68	vs 257.54</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 4.77 gain vs 0.57 gain</p>
<p>Div payable April 18</p>
<p>on register April 4</p>
<p>Full name: Fralex Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Fralex Ltd's sole investment is 57.8 percent in Fraser Alexander Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
